<view class="page-shell"><text class="page-title">三步做好一张图</text><text class="page-subtitle">不用调参数，选择照片和一句祝福就可以。</text><text class="step-title"><text class="step-number">1</text>选择照片</text><button class="photo-picker" bindtap="choosePhoto"><image wx:if="{{photoPath}}" class="photo-preview" src="{{photoPath}}" mode="aspectFill"></image><view wx:else class="photo-empty"><text class="add-mark">＋</text><text>从相册选择或拍一张</text></view></button><text class="step-title"><text class="step-number">2</text>选择祝福语</text><view class="copy-list"><button wx:for="{{copies}}" wx:key="*this" class="copy-option {{selectedCopy === index ? 'copy-option-active' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="chooseCopy">{{item}}</button></view><text class="step-title"><text class="step-number">3</text>生成作品</text><button class="primary-button" loading="{{generating}}" bindtap="generateWork">生成并放入相册</button></view>
